Z||000000||86SE||06-26-2000||02:02 AM||||I have heard if you have a 4 or 5 manual shift trans with a V6 in a Fiero, rev it to 4000 RPM and dump the clutch, white smoke will steam out of the wheel wells WHILE emitting a loud screatching noise.<P>Is this a problem on all V6 Fieros??  Will my auto ever have this problem??  Everyone says Fieros are "flaming death traps" this just isnt good for their reputation.....<P>Will the recall work solve this problem??<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">||||reg||11
