Z||000010||86SE||06-27-2000||01:04 AM||||Now I just had it happen to me!!  I was backing my car onto the cement to work on it, and my front tires got caught on the edge, I had my door open a few inches while looking out of it to se where I was going, then my back tires emitted a very high pitched squeeling noise and left behind a long black mark on the pavement.<P>So watch out, autos have this problem too!!||||reg||8
